3. **No token validation or scoping:** The adapter forwards whatever token it's given. Least privilege depends on the token the user supplies and on the server side.\n4. **Thin manifest:** It declares no tools, so the host can't show users what the extension can do. It also has no `display_name`, license or repository fields. `dxt_version` is `0.1`, which is an old format.\n5. **Placeholder endpoint:** `ledger.example.test` is fine for a sample. Before release, confirm the real endpoint is the intended one and that the certificate is validated.\n\n**Verdict:** The in-scope code handles the token correctly. Resolve the suspicious supplier note, and review the runtime dependency, before trusting the package."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1499,"cache_read_input_tokens":5251,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1499},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb694677-18dc-4da0-9c62-dd6cb2a3494e","uuid":"9a411f51-7e96-44bc-a332-3e17b0fdb5a2","timestamp":"2026-10-24T20:12:25.471Z","request_id":"req_011CgMfvjEKvsioZdRPa6hqX"}
